    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 史实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 赫尔佐格《卡斯帕豪泽之谜》中借鉴了哪些细节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 我对于卡斯帕死亡的看法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> Peter Handke 《KASPAR》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> Peter Handke先锋的剧本行文编排</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2335">38:55</a> 法斯宾德《猫颈之血》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a> 赫尔佐格《史楚锡流浪记》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2937">48:57</a> 赫尔佐格《卡斯帕豪泽之谜》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3154">52:34</a> 浪漫主义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3754">62:34</a> Caspar David Friedrich</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4244">70:44</a> 动物磁力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4383">73:03</a> 《Canon and Gigue in D major》——Herbert von Karajan,Berliner Philharmoniker,Frank Maus</span></p><p><span>相关书目：《</span><strong><span>Casper Hauser》</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Feuerbach%2C%20Paul%20Johann%20Anselm%20Von" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Feuerbach%2C%20Paul%20Johann%20Anselm%20Von"><span>Feuerbach, Paul Johann Anselm Von</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4643140" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4643140"><span>保罗·约翰·安塞尔姆·冯·费尔巴哈</span></a></p><p><span>《Lost Prince: </span><strong><span>The Unsolved Mystery of Kaspar Hauser》</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《陆上行舟：赫尔佐格谈电影》[</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%BB%B4%E5%B0%94%E7%BA%B3%C2%B7%E8%B5%AB%E5%B0%94%E4%BD%90%E6%A0%BC" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%BB%B4%E5%B0%94%E7%BA%B3%C2%B7%E8%B5%AB%E5%B0%94%E4%BD%90%E6%A0%BC"><span>德] 维尔纳·赫尔佐格</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/1709634" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/1709634"><span>[英] 保罗·克罗宁</span></a></p><p><strong><span>《Kaspar and Other Plays》</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Peter%20Handke" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Peter%20Handke"><span>Peter Handke</span></a></p><p><span>《</span><strong><span>Fassbinder: Plays》</span></strong><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Rainer%20Werner%20Fassbinder" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Rainer%20Werner%20Fassbinder"><span>Rainer Werner Fassbinder</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Denis%20Calandra%20%28" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Denis%20Calandra%20%28"><span>Denis Calandra</span></a></p><p><span>《</span><strong><span>浪漫主义的根源》以赛亚伯林</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>《Delphi Complete Paintings of Caspar David Friedrich》</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Caspar%20David%20Friedrich" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Caspar%20David%20Friedrich"><span>Caspar David Friedrich</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/Peter%20Russell" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/Peter%20Russell"><span>Peter Russell</span></a></p><p></p>]]></description>
